{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 43, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life. \n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Outer Market in Tokyo, where I sampled some of the freshest sushi I've ever had. The vibrant atmosphere and bustling streets were a feast for the senses, with vendors calling out to passersby and the sound of sizzling food filling the air.\n\nI also had the opportunity to explore the beautiful city of Kyoto, with its stunning temples and gardens. The Fushimi Inari shrine, with its thousands of vermilion torii gates, was a breathtaking sight, and the peaceful gardens of the Kiyomizu-dera temple provided a serene escape from the hustle and bustle of city life.\n\nThroughout my journey, I was struck by the Japanese people's politeness and hospitality. Everywhere I went, I was greeted with a smile and a bow, and I felt welcomed and at ease. Japan is a country that seamlessly blends tradition and innovation, and my trip was a fascinating glimpse into its rich culture and history. I'm already planning my next trip back to this incredible country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.5595460534095764}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.004180265124887228}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -8.4638240878121e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20429882407188416}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5806933641433716}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.00042775063775479794}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.0002615109842736274}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.00016842853801790625}, {"token": " From", "logprob": -